> **(Important Licensing Note)**
> This project employs a layered licensing approach.
> 1.  Individual source code files are governed by the **BSD 3-Clause License**.
> 2.  PHOVOS-distributed *packages* of "The Software" (including source, binaries, and accompanying materials) are governed by **CC BY-ND 4.0**. This means redistribution of modified *packages* is not permitted.
> 3.  Any code or data generated *automatically* by the project's inherent "quine-like" mechanisms is dedicated to the public domain under **CC0 1.0**.

The **full legal texts** (verbatim) for all referenced licenses appear after § 6 and control in any conflict.

